# =============================================================================
# Diligently — desktop (Tauri) environment
# =============================================================================
#
# HOW TO USE
# -----------
# 1. Copy this file to `.env` in this same folder (diligent/src-tauri/.env).
#    (`scripts/setup` does this for you.)
# 2. Fill in the keys below (no quotes needed).
# 3. Start / restart the app (`npm run tauri dev`).
#
# `.env` is gitignored. Commit only `.env.example`.
#
# Bring your own LLM key(s) — the app talks directly to the provider you choose,
# never to a hosted service. You only need ONE chat provider (OpenAI, DeepSeek,
# or Anthropic). Tavily is optional (powers the company-research step).

# =============================================================================
# OpenAI & DeepSeek — LLM chat + job/CV generation
# =============================================================================
# If a provider's key/model is left empty in Settings, the app falls back to
# these values.
#
#   OpenAI:   https://platform.openai.com/   -> API keys -> Create new secret key
#   DeepSeek: https://platform.deepseek.com/ -> API keys -> create key
#
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-pro

# =============================================================================
# Anthropic (Claude) — optional alternative chat / vision provider
# =============================================================================
# https://console.anthropic.com/  -> Settings -> API Keys -> Create Key (sk-ant-...)
# Model IDs: claude-sonnet-4-6 (default), claude-haiku-4-5-20251001 (faster).
#
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6

# =============================================================================
# Tavily Search — company research ("Research" tab; Rust `web_search`)
# =============================================================================
# Optional, but recommended for the Research step.
#   1. Sign up free at https://app.tavily.com/ (no card required).
#   2. Copy the API key (it starts with `tvly-`).
# Free tier ~1,000 credits/month; ~2 queries per research run. Read at runtime,
# so no rebuild is needed after setting it — just restart the app.
#
TAVILY_API_KEY=
